ser(id: \"1\") {...</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2025-11-25T15:42:11.670454+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://docs.moieo.net/protodocs/graphql/basic-concepts/", "url": "https://docs.moieo.net/protodocs/graphql/basic-concepts/", "title": "GraphQL \u57fa\u672c\u6982\u5ff5", "content_html": "<h1>GraphQL \u57fa\u672c\u6982\u5ff5</h1>\n<h2>\u6838\u5fc3\u6982\u5ff5</h2>\n<h3>1. Schema\uff08\u6a21\u5f0f\uff09</h3>\n<p>GraphQL Schema \u5b9a\u4e49\u4e86 API \u7684\u7c7b\u578b\u7cfb\u7edf\uff0c\u63cf\u8ff0\u4e86\u53ef\u7528\u7684\u6570\u636e\u548c\u64cd\u4f5c\u3002</p>\n<p>```graphql</p>\n<h1>Schema \u5b9a\u4e49\u793a\u4f8b</h1>\n<p>type Query {\n  user(id: ID!): User\n  posts: [...</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2025-11-25T15:42:11.655304+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}